I think the main problem could be that you are not reading the file correctly, there are blogposts at zvfak.blogspot.com <http://zvfak.blogspot.com> and code in this forum showing how to read bsmap files, or any other generic methylation ratio/percentage per base file.

In addition, Kalyan is right. Assuming, you are reading the file correctly, you would see a lot of unmethylated Cs, but I would also expect a small bump towards the end.

Best,
Altuna

